    <h1 itemprop="headline">Tree Sap Use by Birds and Mammals in the Mukundara Hills Landscape</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Over the summer of 2026 I kept returning to three trees that were leaking sap. Birds came to one of them,
      langurs to the others, and in July a pair of Indian Pittas turned up at a dried patch of it on the ground.
    </p>
