      <h2>What I am not claiming</h2>
      <p>
        I am not saying the birds were medicating themselves, or that the heat made them come more often. Nobody has
        tested this sap, and I didn't keep timed watches. These are notes on what I saw, written down so that someone
        with the time and the means can look properly.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you know trees like these in the area, please leave them and their sap alone.
      </p>
    </div>

